  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Details : </strong><a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"http://www.rrcb.gov.in/rrbs.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Railway Recruitment Board (RRB)</a></span> has release the CBAT Exam City Details for the posts of Section Controller. This recruitment was released for 368 posts. Applications for the Railway RRB RRB Section Controller Recruitment 2025 were accepted from 15 September 2025, to 15 October 2025. The CBAT examination examination is going to be conducted on 06 June 2026. Candidates who qualified for this CBT I examination can download their Railway RRB Section Controller CBAT Exam City Details 2026 from the link provided below.</span></span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Railway Recruitment Board (RRB)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Railway RRB Section Controller CBAT Exam City Details 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">RRB Section Controller Advt. No. CEN 04/2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>15 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>14 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>16 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Form Corrections Last Date : <strong>17-26 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Application Status Available : <strong>12 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>11-12 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam City Details : <strong>03 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>07 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer key Available : <strong>26 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result : <strong>08 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">CBAT Exam Date : <strong>06 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">CBAT Exam City Details : <strong>28 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC, EWS : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>500/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH <b>: Rs. 250/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Category Female&nbsp;<b>: Rs. 250/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minorities / 3rd Gender<strong> : Rs. 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><b>After Appear the Stage I Exam</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">UR, OBC, EWS Fee Refund : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>400/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC,&nbsp; ST, PH, Female Refund <b>: Rs. 250/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Railway RRB Section Controller Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>As on 01 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age : <b>20 Years</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age : <b>33 Years</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per RRB Section Controller Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Use <span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Railway RRB Section Controller 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 368 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Category&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Section Controller</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">174</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">24</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">80</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">56</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">34</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>RRB Zone Wise Vacancy Details – <span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/CEN_04_2025_Section_Controller_CEN_08_09_2025-38.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></span></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Railway RRB Section Controller Recruitment 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates who have Bachelor Degree in Any Stream from any recognized University in India will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Railway RRB Section Controller Online Form 2025 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Computer Based Test (CBT)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Computer Based Aptitude Test (CBAT)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification (DV) </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download Railway RRB Section Controller CBAT Exam City Details 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must go to the&nbsp;<strong>Important Links</strong>&nbsp;section below</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates must click on the&nbsp;<strong>Download CBAT Exam City Details</strong>&nbsp;link.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After clicking on the link, the candidates will be redirected to a new page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page, candidates have to enter the following details:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Registration no.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Login ID</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Birth Date/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Captcha Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates have to&nbsp; submit the details by clicking on the Login button.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After successful login, candidates will be able to download the CBAT Exam City Details.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Alternatively, the candidates can download the RRB Section Controller CBAT Exam City Details from the official website of RRB also.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"width: 100.27%;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Check Zone Wise RRB Section Controller Result 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Region Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Exam Result</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Cutoff</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><b>RRB Allahabad</b></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/